 "description": "Black-Scholes (BSM) option greeks calculator \u2014 pass spot, strike, days-to-expiry, volatility and option type to get delta, gamma, theta, vega (and higher-order greeks where returned). Example: flashalpha_greeks({ spot: 100, strike: 105, dte: 30, vol: 0.25, type: \"call\", _apiKey: \"your-key\" })",
